    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br/><math><msup><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>'</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br/><img src=\"assets\\st0014_6e62133e8fc7.png\"/><br/><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> has maxima at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br/>and minima at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br/>now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></munderover><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>17</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br/><math><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>17</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow